 annuity products. The Group Insurance segment offers various group life, and long-term and short-term group disability, as well as group corporate-, bank-, and trust-owned life insurance; and supplemental health solutions including accident, critical illness, and hospital indemnity. The Individual Life segment develops and distributes variable life, universal life, and term life insurance products. The International Businesses segment develops and distributes life insurance, retirement products, investment products, and certain accident and health products. The company provides its products and services to individual and institutional customers through its proprietary and third-party distribution networks, financial professionals, and trusted partnerships. Prudential Financial, Inc. was founded in 1875 and is headquartered in Newark, New Jersey.","employees":36607,"website":"https://www.prudential.com","country":"United States","city":"Newark","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Andrew Francis Sullivan","title":"Chairman, CEO & President"},{"name":"Ms. Yanela del Carmen Frias","title":"Executive VP & CFO"},{"name":"Mr. Scott E. Case","title":"Executive VP & Head of Global Technology and Operations"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":10.82,"tpe":12.76,"ps":3.533,"pfcf":12.17,"peg":1.32,"pb":1.628,"ev_ebitda":10.81,"rev_growth":0.091,"eps_growth":0.138,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1351,"eps_growth_next":0.1043,"div_yield":0.02205,"roe":0.1287,"roa":0.01564,"de":54.12,"gross_margin":0.2367,"op_margin":0.3641,"profit_margin":0.2565,"current_ratio":1.513},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":9.252,"sector":10.82,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":10.76,"sector":12.76,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":0.6698,"sector":3.533,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":5.804,"sector":12.17,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":0.88,"sector":1.32,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Boo